tiktoken
https://github.com/openai/tiktoken
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Used in: internal/tokenize (ADR 0053).

- internal/tokenize/data/o200k_base.bin.gz and cl100k_base.bin.gz are the
  o200k_base and cl100k_base rank files published by OpenAI
  (https://openaipublic.blob.core.windows.net/encodings/), checked against the
  sha256 tiktoken publishes and stored in a compact, gzip-compressed form.
- The pre-tokenizer of internal/tokenize reproduces the o200k_base and
  cl100k_base split patterns of tiktoken_ext/openai_public.py, and the merge
  follows tiktoken's byte-pair merge (src/lib.rs). No tiktoken code is
  copied verbatim.
- internal/tokenize/testdata/golden.json was generated with tiktoken.

